      "content": "the \"quiet\" sounds almost nice, but it's scary too. because if i stop the performance, if i stop trying to keep up the charade of being a person... there's nothing underneath. it's just empty. it feels like the only way to actually stop the exhaustion would be to just... stop everything. to finally be as empty as i feel.",
